@startuml Initialization

skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor White
skinparam ActivityBorderColor Black

!startsub INITIALIZATION
partition "Initialization (base)" {
    :Receive **Molecule**
    (atoms, per-atom charges, multiplicity,
     basis sets already validated);

    :Read **charge** = Σ atom.charge
    Read **multiplicity** from Molecule;

    :Compute total electron count
    <latex>N_{elec} = \sum_i Z_i + \text{charge}</latex>;

    :Convert coordinates
    Ångström → Bohr;
}

partition "HartreeFock (base)" {
    :Compute **n_basis**
    (total contracted Gaussians);
    :Declare shared attributes
    <latex>N_{\alpha}</latex>, <latex>N_{\beta}</latex> (set by subclass);

    switch (HF Method?)
    case (RHF)
        partition "RHF – Restricted Closed-Shell" <<#LightGreen>> {
            if (<latex>N_{elec}</latex> is odd?) then (yes)
                :Raise **ValueError**
                "RHF requires even electrons"; <<#tomato>>
                end
            else (no)
            endif
            if (multiplicity ≠ 1?) then (yes)
                :Raise **ValueError**
                "RHF requires singlet"; <<#tomato>>
                end
            else (no)
            endif
            :<latex>N_{occ} = N_{elec} / 2</latex>
            <latex>N_{\alpha} = N_{\beta} = N_{occ}</latex>; <<#LightGreen>>
        }
    case (UHF)
        partition "UHF – Unrestricted" <<#LightCoral>> {
            :<latex>n_{unpaired} = M - 1</latex>; <<#LightCoral>>
            :<latex>N_{\beta} = (N_{elec} - n_{unpaired}) / 2</latex>
            <latex>N_{\alpha} = N_{\beta} + n_{unpaired}</latex>; <<#LightCoral>>
        }
    case (ROHF)
        partition "ROHF – Restricted Open-Shell" <<#LightYellow>> {
            :<latex>n_{unpaired} = M - 1</latex>
            <latex>n_{paired} = N_{elec} - n_{unpaired}</latex>; <<#LightYellow>>
            if (<latex>n_{paired}</latex> is odd?) then (yes)
                :Raise **ValueError**
                "Paired electrons not even"; <<#tomato>>
                end
            else (no)
            endif
            :<latex>N_{closed} = n_{paired} / 2</latex>
            <latex>N_{open}   = n_{unpaired}</latex>; <<#LightYellow>>
            :<latex>N_{\beta}  = N_{closed}</latex>
            <latex>N_{\alpha} = N_{closed} + N_{open}</latex>; <<#LightYellow>>
            :Verify <latex>M = N_{open} + 1</latex>; <<#LightYellow>>
        }
    endswitch
}

:▼ **Transfer to Integral Computation →**
• Molecule (atoms in Bohr)
• <latex>N_{elec}</latex>, charge, multiplicity
• n_basis (contracted Gaussians)
• RHF: <latex>N_{occ}</latex>
  UHF: <latex>N_{\alpha}, N_{\beta}</latex>
  ROHF: <latex>N_{closed}, N_{open}</latex>
• hf_method ∈ {RHF, UHF, ROHF}; <<#LightBlue>>

stop
!endsub

legend right
    **Symbol Legend:**
    |= Symbol |= Description |
    | <latex>Z_i</latex> | Atomic number of atom //i// |
    | charge | Sum of per-atom formal charges |
    | <latex>N_{elec}</latex> | Total number of electrons |
    | <latex>N_{occ}</latex> | Doubly-occupied orbitals (RHF) |
    | <latex>N_{\alpha}</latex> | Alpha (spin-up) electrons |
    | <latex>N_{\beta}</latex> | Beta (spin-down) electrons |
    | <latex>N_{closed}</latex> | Doubly-occupied orbitals (ROHF) |
    | <latex>N_{open}</latex> | Singly-occupied orbitals (ROHF) |
    | <latex>M</latex> | Spin multiplicity (2S + 1) |
    | Bohr | Atomic unit of length (1 Bohr ≈ 0.529 Å) |
    ----
    **HF Method Colors:**
    |<#LightGreen> RHF | Restricted Closed-Shell |
    |<#LightCoral> UHF | Unrestricted |
    |<#LightYellow> ROHF | Restricted Open-Shell |
    ----
    **Class Hierarchy:**
    Initialization → HartreeFock → { RHF, UHF, ROHF }
endlegend

@enduml
